# The CSV backup taken from Prisma Studio on 2026-09-12, when the Postgres
# account hit its plan limit and pg_dump was no longer possible. It is the only
# copy of the database, and it stays **out of git**: `Account` carries a bcrypt
# hash for all 733 users and `Employee` carries 731 real people's records, and
# git history is forever. Keep it backed up somewhere else, not here.
utils/backup/
